{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00547","headline":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 肃和 · 贺知章、源乾曜","name":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄只是[祗]，我其夙夜。\n寅畏诚絜，匪遑宁舍。\n礼以琮玉，荐厥茅藉。\n念兹降康，胡宁克暇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章、源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}